                                "text": "There, working alongside graduates of elite institutions, [Ravi Kumar] discovered his potential. \"I didn't go to an IIT [Indian Institute of Technology], but I felt like, 'Wait a minute, I'm able to compete with these guys,\" he says. Today, he runs Cognizant, a $36 billion global technology company with nearly 350,000 employees."
